\p{The voltage is held at #{0} mV. Each variable starts at its rest
value in \ref{fnip-0073} and follows the explicit solution. Solid
is #{n}, dashed is #{m}, and dotted is #{h}. The drawing follows
Figure 1.12 on p. 24.}
